      "content": "but there's no making it \"less unbearable\" when the weight just keeps growing. it's like i'm just a witness to everything going wrong. i see people at their absolute worst and most broken, and i realize we're all just... fading out. sometimes it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just stop participating in the whole thing. to just step away from the noise entirely.",
